# Barcode Generation Anti-Patterns

## Generating barcode as image file — slow, unnecessary

```java
// WRONG — save PNG, load ImageView
File barcodeFile = File.createTempFile("barcode", ".png");
ImageIO.write(bitMap, "png", barcodeFile);
```

**Generate as BufferedImage, convert to JavaFX Image directly. No I/O.**

## Hardcoding barcode size

```java
// WRONG — fixed size looks bad when resized
MultiFormatWriter.encode(content, BarcodeFormat.QR_CODE, 200, 200);
```

**Size based on container dimensions. Regenerate on resize.**

## Missing error correction for QR codes

```java
// WRONG — no correction level, damaged codes are unreadable
```

**Always set error correction: EncodeHintType.ERROR_CORRECTION = ErrorCorrectionLevel.M**